{"quest_id": 4533, "name": "天使の行軍", "description": "魔法を操る新たな天使が\n解き放たれた！\n天使の侵攻を全力で阻め！\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "堕天使の誕生", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920064, "map_no": 3675, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 18, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2101072, "race_id": 6, "master_id": 648, "global_id": 647, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 5}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 153, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097360, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 16, "spawn_sec": 25}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 40}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2500, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 20, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 100, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 121, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2105456, "race_id": 6, "missile_id": 149, "missile": {"speed": 3.0}, "master_id": 649, "global_id": 648, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 67}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 150, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 25, "attack_interval": 83, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2100640, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 225, "missile_id": 22, "missile": {"speed": 10.0}, "master_id": 653, "global_id": 652, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 97}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1200, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 160, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 1800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098240, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 15, "missile": {"speed": 2.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 76, "global_id": 75, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 111}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "天使の皆さん、どうか侵攻を止めてください！\n私達の話を聞いてください！", "face": "lca552ed7785e"}, {"name": "天使", "text": "なぜ我ら天使を追いかけてくる……？　", "face": "lad0074422edf"}, {"name": "天使", "text": "堕天使どもの手先か……？　\n命令遂行の妨害をするならば排除する。", "face": "lad0074422edf"}, {"name": "エルン", "text": "……やはり。\n彼らは、千年戦争の頃に神から指令を受けた\n天使達の生き残りのようです。", "face": "u202"}, {"name": "エルン", "text": "浄化の対象は……人間です。", "face": "u202"}, {"name": "ドロシー", "text": "じゃあ神様が人間を滅ぼそうとしてるって事？！\nそんなの嘘だよ！\nそんなこと……あるはずないよ……。", "face": "u132"}, {"name": "天使", "text": "祈れ、地上の子らよ。\nこれは、神の剣による断罪だ。", "face": "lad0074422edf"}, {"name": "エルン", "text": "王子……、\n神の意志は天使にとって絶対です。\n迎え撃つしかありません……。", "face": "u202"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 94, "lines": [{"name": "シャルロット", "text": "天使だか何だか知りませんが、アタシの\n魔法剣で、足止めしてさしあげますわッ！　", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "天使", "text": "はかなき人の子よ……。\n未熟な精神なれば……。\n操るのは……容易い。", "face": "lad0074422edf"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "――きゃぁァアッ！？\nそんな、身体が、うごか……ない……？", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "ニエル", "text": "天使達に操られてるんだ！\n天使たちの力なら、\n未熟な人間を操ることは不可能じゃないよ！", "face": "u206"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "誰が未熟ですってぇ――ふぁッ！？\nか、勝手に魔法剣が発動しちゃいましたわ！\n……お願いですわ、誰か止めてください～！！", "face": "u128"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "シャルロット", "text": "はぁ……はぁ……何とか、助かりましたわ。\n前にもこんなこと、あったのに……、\nアタシ、まだまだ未熟ですわ……。", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "エルン", "text": "天使達の力は人間には推し量れない\n特殊なものなので仕方ありません。\n元気出してください、シャルロットさん。", "face": "u202"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "気遣いは無用ですわッ！\nこの汚名は、これからの戦いにて、\n絶対にそそがせていただきますわッ！！", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "さぁ！　王子！\n天使たちを追いかけますわよ！", "face": "u128"}]}], "active": true}